        {
          "text": "Agho obwire obwo, malaika wa Musengwa Katonda yaaja mu kifo Abassiria ghe baasimba weema dhaibwe, yaita abantu emitwalo ikumi na munaana n'enkumi itaanu (185,000). Abantu bwe baazuuka ku nkyo, baaja okulinga bati ng'abo boonaboona mirambo!",
          "type": "text",
