        {
          "text": "Lwali lulala bweyali mu isabo ng'ali kusinza omusambwa gwe Nisiroki, batabane be Adurammeleki ni Sharezeri baamwita n'empiima, baamala baalumukira mu nsi y'e Ararati. Agho mutabane we owundi Esarahaddoni yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
